<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Reliance Insurance 96 profit up 43 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Reliance Insurance 96 profit up 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Gross premium Income  230.8	  vs	   221.97</p>
<p>    Net premium Income    140.56	 vs	   134.35</p>
<p>    Net Profit		 47.44	 vs	    33.17</p>
<p>    Gross Claims	     67.1	  vs	    68.18</p>
<p>    Total Reserves	  200.98	 vs	   177.02</p>
<p>    Dividend	   30 taka on 100- taka share vs 20 taka</p>
<p>(Note: Bangladesh Reliance Insurance Limited announced its result at its annual general meeting on Wednesday. The company, a general insurance company, said it could achieve good result despite a difficult year because of political unrest.</p>
</text>
